{
  "summary": "This experiment tested replacing avgpool with transformer aggregation in a multiprofile setup using scvi_n200 encoder, achieving validation accuracy of 0.653 and F1 of 0.628, slightly higher than the avgpool baseline (0.650 and 0.6275). The marginal improvement suggests transformer aggregation may contribute to performance gains, though uncertainty remains about its relative effectiveness compared to other methods due to limited direct comparisons."
}

